WEBVTT

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.030
Big Bro!

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.660
Look at this!

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.890
I thought up a new finishing move!

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.610
Hey, Big Bro!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:28.640
My finishing move! Wanna see?

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>Lately, Gashita has started 
taking on gathering quests too.</i>

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.980
Do you? Do you? Do you?

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.210
Wanna know what my finishing move is?

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.960
I get it. After we finish 
this job, all right?

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.880
All right! We'll finish this up in a flash!

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.920
And after that, I'm hoping 
for some grueling training!

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.930
<i>It's better than being treated as an enemy...</i>

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:43.100
<i>but it's a little bit of a nuisance.</i>

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.290
<i>However...</i>

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.050
<i>There's something that's 
even harder to handle.</i>

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:52.780
I'm back!

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.540
Welcome home!

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:07.230
Huh?

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.840
Um, Mister Dariel?

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.630
<i>Things with her escalate daily.</i>

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:15.590
Mister Dariel? Mister Dariel!

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.310
<i>But other than that...</i>

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.830
<i>my second life is progressing smoothly.</i>

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:26.100
<i>In the midst of all this, 
I noticed something...</i>

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.680
<i>a mystery this village is hiding.</i>

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:49.670
<b>Chillin'</b>

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:49.670
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:13.500
I was wondering, Mayor...

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:18.220
Why are there so many empty 
houses in this village?

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:24.140
That will take a little time to explain.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.930
Malika! Will you bring me a map please?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.160
Malika?

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:31.890
I'll go and see.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:39.900
Miss Malika?

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:43.530
It's no good. I just can't control myself.

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.030
At this rate, one day, I'll...

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:48.950
Mister Dariel, I'll...

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:53.750
Miss Malika, what happened earlier, 
was just a sort of accident.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.180
A-A map, wasn't it?

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:01.850
I'll go get one!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.500
You were asking why there are so many 
empty houses in this village, right?

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.470
Yes.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.580
That's because...

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:17.520
this is all that remains of a place
that was once full of life.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.780
Beyond this village

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.530
lies one of the most important 
sites for the human race...

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.860
a mythril mine.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.870
Mythril mine?

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:32.600
Mythril is a metal with 
many mysterious properties.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:37.580
Weapons made with it boast 
of unparalleled performance.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:42.340
<i>Mythril is just as important to demons.</i>

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:46.350
<i>It can be used to make magical equipment...
 that is, items that store magical energy.</i>

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:50.190
And so the scramble for 
possession of the mine...

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.670
continued for several hundred years.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:57.800
Lux Village was a stopping place 
in the mythril transport route.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:00.840
It flourished as an inn town.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:06.450
But when I was a child, 
the demons took the mine.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.830
We did try to take it back,

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:14.200
but we failed, and now we've
more or less given up.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:21.670
Since then, this village has 
declined further and further.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:26.510
Mine will probably be the last generation 
that knows how busy this place once was.

00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:32.120
Lux Village is destined to slowly die.

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:40.720
<i>The mythril mine, huh?</i>

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:45.900
<i>I haven't been there in 
a while. Maybe I'll go...</i>

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.490
<i>back to what was once my workplace.</i>

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.370
I wonder if everyone's doing well.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.380
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.380
<b>Dariel Goes to His Old Workplace.</b>

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:15.000
<i>If I can negotiate to get even 
a little of the mythril from here,</i>

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.890
<i>it will benefit Lux Village.</i>

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:20.150
<i>I hope there's someone here 
who's willing to talk.</i>

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.500
<i>In any case, I'm no longer 
part of the Demon King's Army,</i>

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.450
<i>so I'm risking getting captured.</i>

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:43.130
<i>This is strange.</i>

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.250
<i>It was so easy to sneak in.</i>

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:51.460
<i>If I'd had security this lax, Lord Bashbarza 
would have burned me to a crisp.</i>

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.740
<i>There's no one here.</i>

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.900
<i>Has something happened to all the demons?</i>

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.820
Hey!

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:15.810
Is anyone here?

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:43.770
Zaza!

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:48.780
Adonis! Vesper! Borga! Gimlet!

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:52.030
Master Dariel!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.930
It's Master Dariel!

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.780
Is this a dream?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.800
It's really him!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.790
It's been a long time, everyone!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.110
It's been so long!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:03.140
Hey, what happened to the mine?

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.250
What? What is it?

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:10.760
<i>First, I'll have to calm them down.</i>

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.470
We'll take turns getting a pat on the head!

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.500
Line up properly!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.230
There, there. Have you been well?

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:24.730
Four times as much?

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:28.730
Yes. The amount of mythril we have 
to supply has increased far too much.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:32.140
So, it's different than 
when I was in charge here?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.180
Who gave these orders?

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:38.740
We heard that it's someone really high up.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.690
Um... what was it again?

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:43.080
Dumdummy?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.000
It had a more stylish sound to it.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.420
Maybe Kasbahzah?

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:50.100
No, it's Lord Ughbarza.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:52.720
No, it's not. It's Lord Bozobarza, isn't it?

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:56.560
No! I don't think that's it.
 I thought it was...

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.440
<i>Lord Bashbarza...</i>

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:01.110
<i>Did the Knockers do something
to offend him?</i>

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.120
<i>No, they wouldn't have
had any contact with him.</i>

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:10.740
Master Dariel, when you were 
in charge was the best of all.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:14.360
You're the only one who calls us by our names.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:19.190
In the name of economizing, they withdrew 
the soldiers who were here before.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:22.240
At this rate, we'll have no choice 
but to run away in the night.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:24.250
I see.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.030
<i>They don't work under me anymore.</i>

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.270
<i>I can't do anything for them.</i>

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.130
<i>But...</i>

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:35.000
<i>If I don't do anything, 
I'd feel so sorry for the Knockers.</i>

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:39.090
<i>They've worked so hard 
to mine the mythril for us.</i>

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.310
New soldiers!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.560
They've come to collect the mythril!

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.160
What is the meaning of this?

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:09.080
This is very obviously not enough mythril.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.180
Are you really working hard enough,
 you pieces of trash?

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.010
M-My lord administrator!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:17.700
Asking us for four times as 
much is just too unreasonable!

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:20.050
<i>So, that's the new commander?</i>

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.510
<i>I've never seen him before.</i>

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:24.200
We beg you!

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.970
Wait just a little longer!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:34.000
Don't speak to me as though you are my equal!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.610
You are demi-humans only 
fit for serving demons!

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:43.120
Don't forget! My orders are the will 
of Lord Bashbarza of the Four Generals!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.550
<i>One of Lord Bashbarza's sycophants, is he?</i>

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:49.000
<i>Even so, he's being too brutal.</i>

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:52.460
You've wasted my precious time.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:57.050
If you don't have it ready by tomorrow, 
be prepared for the consequences.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:09.850
We're not enduring this anymore!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.280
'S right!

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:14.110
'S right! 'S right! 'S right!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.980
<i>Th-This is bad!</i>

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.980
'S right! 'S right! 'S right!

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:21.990
Kill them! Kill all the mutinous traitors!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.320
<i>That's absurd!</i>

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.880
<i>The Knockers are craftsmen.</i>

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.620
<i>They're non-combatants!</i>

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.450
<i>It's obvious who will win!</i>

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.790
Verdant source, send the 
wisdom of your envoy here,

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.540
<i>This is bad! This magic is...</i>

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.570
and breathe forth endless clear blades!

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.500
Release... Gales!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:41.460
What did you do?!

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:44.010
I-It wasn't me! Something came flying out!

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.650
Withdraw, O noble soldiers 
of the Demon King's Army!

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:03.120
Is your magic meant for the 
killing of non-combatants?

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:06.520
And who are you?

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:09.320
A human adventurer.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.080
If you will not withdraw...

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:13.430
then you will face me!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:19.090
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.250
If you will not withdraw...

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.100
then you will face me!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.610
<i>What is this smell?</i>

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.730
<i>Is it some kind of new magic?</i>

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:40.070
Huh?

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:43.570
The underwear I left here is gone!

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.510
They're the ones I drew a flower on!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.700
<i>Is that what this is?</i>

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:50.080
That guy's using that underwear...

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.790
H-He's some kind of pervert.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.670
<i>I-I'd like to take them off...</i>

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:57.090
<i>but I can't show my face here.</i>

00:12:57.090 --> 00:12:58.210
<i>Just stop thinking about it!</i>

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.800
<i>Right now, what I have to do is...</i>

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.680
If you withdraw, I will not pursue!

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:09.340
If you would fight, then send first 
those who have no care for their lives!

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:16.020
You can't fight without relying 
on a weapon, you pathetic human.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:20.080
Aiding and abetting the Knockers 
to try to steal the mythril mine...

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.530
It's contemptible.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:23.210
Contemptible?

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:24.950
Yes, that's right.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.680
I did think it was strange.

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:31.250
These guys are happy just digging holes.
 For them to rebel...

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:34.080
The mere fact that they had the unwelcome 
wit to do such a thing was odd!

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.900
You command these craftsmen, these Knockers,

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.590
and steal their pride from them. 
Doesn't that make you contemptible?

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.880
And what of it?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.300
I am a commander who receives orders 
directly from Lord Bashbarza!

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.840
Vermin, prepare yourselves!

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:56.360
I'll see you and that human 
all covered in blood!

00:13:57.490 --> 00:13:59.440
<i>I guess I have no choice.</i>

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.230
<i>But I don't want to hurt 
them if I can help it.</i>

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.560
Would you mind?

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:09.280
Huh?

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:14.000
Oh, I feel so embarrassed!

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.500
Everyone, hide!

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:16.900
What?

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.630
He sheathed his blade?

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:22.840
Final crimson rays of sunset,

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.690
send the wisdom of your envoy here,

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.090
and for those remaining wicked 
spirits who would block the way...

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:29.720
<i>That chant requires intense concentration.</i>

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.340
a cage of purification...

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:30.340
<i>Which means...</i>

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.350
<i>If I can land one hit, I can stop him!</i>

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.760
We're gonna fight too!

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.040
Yeah!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.100
Stay back!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.120
Verdure beyond the heavens...

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:44.070
<i>Oh no! The chant is almost over!</i>

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:45.700
...gather the fangs of the storm...

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:46.930
Out of the way!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.070
<i>He kicked him?</i>

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:52.200
<i>Why didn't he use magic?</i>

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:53.950
<i>I see!</i>

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:59.440
<i>A soldier's work is to battle others 
who also fight for a living.</i>

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:01.500
<i>My words might reach them!</i>

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:05.190
Soldiers of the Demon King's Army!

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:07.010
Have you forgotten your honor?

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.000
I know you know!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.260
If you kill a single non-combatant,

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:14.260
that makes you just a murderer!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.170
<i>Did that reach them?</i>

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.730
Don't listen. It's a 
silly trick of the enemy.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:28.740
All of you, begin your chants!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:33.490
Those who do not obey orders will 
be burned to ash by my magic!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:45.000
Simultaneous chants for each affinity...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.210
If you think you can stop them,
 go ahead and try.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:52.190
Resonance of the azure skies, send to me 
the divine protection of your envoy...

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:54.860
Final crimson rays of sunset, send 
the wisdom of your envoy here...

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:58.720
Verdant thread, send to me the 
divine protection of your envoy

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.480
Th-There's no getting out of this!

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:04.530
...and with the tails of ghosts...

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:04.530
<i>Earth, fire, wind, water...</i>

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:06.660
... and for those remaining wicked spirits...

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:08.860
<i>They take twenty seconds, twelve seconds, 
seventeen seconds, and ten seconds!</i>

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.860
...a beast that obstructs 
ten thousand eyes...

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:12.300
...the reins which will tear all asunder...

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:15.280
...devour me and hide my flesh...

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.460
<i>Why isn't any of the magic activating?</i>

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.520
...send to me the divine 
protection of your envoy.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.520
<i>I-It can't be!</i>

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.000
Gather, groundbreakers of 
the first slaughters...

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:24.000
<i>Is he attacking them in order of 
shortest chant to longest?</i>

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:28.000
<i>He has the chants for 
every affinity memorized?!</i>

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.970
...droplets of the morning stars, 
gather and race downwards... Pierce!

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:33.010
Let me use that.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.260
Change to enhancement magic!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.770
Deo Amam!

00:16:57.670 --> 00:17:00.080
It isn't possible. This is
 a hundred against one!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.400
No...

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.330
it isn't.

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:13.370
It's one against one.

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:16.030
W-Wait, please!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.130
I-I'm not part of the Demon King's Army!

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.590
I'm a non-combatant!

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:23.980
So, please, don't kill me!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:32.440
<i>I just happened to meet Lord Bashbarza 
of the Four Generals at a ball.</i>

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.940
<i>The more we talked the more we got along.</i>

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:38.360
<i>And then he said he'd entrust 
the workings of the mine to me.</i>

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:41.450
<i>He was employed through 
personal connections?!</i>

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:46.830
<i>Lord Bashbarza, did you hire him 
just because you two are friendly?</i>

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.080
<i>Even though you fired me for being useless?</i>

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.290
I'm begging you!

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:56.000
If you kill a non-combatant, 
your warrior's honor will weep.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:56.670
Right?

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.700
If you understand that emotion,

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.850
then why did you order the 
soldiers to kill the Knockers?

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:11.060
They're your subordinates, too.

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:15.070
I wish you had protected them.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.320
I will end this now.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.260
Huh?

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:35.000
When you get home, 
please offer your resignation.

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:40.150
Tell them that the mine is a scary place 
and that you never want to go back again.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.600
You should probably all head home too.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:53.660
Your commander ran away after all.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:03.620
To think Master Dariel was so strong!

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:06.210
But was that all right?

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:09.180
Defeating the Demon King's 
Army's soldiers like that...

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:10.240
It's fine.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:13.500
After all, I'm human.

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.410
Oh...

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:15.880
But, y'know...

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.110
things still aren't good for us!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:19.970
My underwear have finally returned to me.

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:21.890
What if next time even stronger soldiers 
from the Demon King's Army come?

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:23.850
It'll be fine!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:27.100
As long as we have Master Dariel, 
there's nothing to worry about!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.000
Huh? You're putting me in charge?

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:34.300
We'll keep following 
you forever, Master Dariel!

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:37.490
Then, I guess I'll think 
about what to do next.

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:41.250
Hooray! Yay! Yay!

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:47.650
Sir?

00:19:47.650 --> 00:19:49.040
Yes?

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.580
I've recaptured the mythril mine.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.610
And so...

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:59.010
I'd like for us to protect the Knockers.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.680
The Knockers?

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:07.130
But haven't they been on the 
demons' side since long ago?

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:08.370
Please!

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:15.840
All right.

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:21.280
But this is something that 
concerns all of the humans.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.570
We'll send a messenger to 
Center Guild immediately...

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.940
and everyone will consider 
what to do next together.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:28.620
Yes, sir!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:33.980
<i>After that, lots of people 
moved very quickly to help us.</i>

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:39.850
<i>They talked about how, for the first time in 
decades, Mythril Mine was in human hands.</i>

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:42.300
<i>Many regions rejoiced as though 
it were some kind of festival.</i>

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.500
<i>And as for the Knockers...</i>

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:48.970
<i>as they knew every inch of the mine...</i>

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:51.750
<i>they were asked to work as guides.</i>

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:57.550
<i>So change came to Lux Village as well.</i>

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:02.950
Dariel...

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:05.700
I'd long given up on this.

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:10.180
I thought that Lux Village 
would continue to slowly die.

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:13.710
But you changed the fate of our village.

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:16.900
It was just some good luck, that's all.

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:20.080
Then you're an envoy of good luck.

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.490
Mister Dariel!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:24.970
Would you like to eat lunch together?

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:29.430
Yes, I was just starting 
to get hungry, so—

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:35.170
Malika!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:37.340
Ma...

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:39.690
Ma...

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:49.840
You just called me Malika!

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:52.550
You didn't use the "Miss!" It was as 
though I was your very own!

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.100
Big Bro?

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.710
I want you to call my 
name like that every day!

00:21:57.200 --> 00:22:00.030
Mister Dariel, I...

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:04.950
M...

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:09.640
Mister Dariel!

00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:45.860
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s After 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>...

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:48.820
"Dariel Negotiates."

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:51.110
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:51.110
<b>Dariel Negotiates.</b>

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.110
<b></b>
